OL,3,GNEWSAPavement parking ban moves a step 
OL,4,Acloser                                 
OL,6,FOxfordshire could soon become the first
OL,7,Fplace in England outside of London to  
OL,8,Fban motorists from parking on          
OL,9,Fpavements, after a local authority     
OL,10,Fagreed to progress with the plans.     
OL,12,FAt a meeting on Tuesday, Oxfordshire   
OL,13,FCounty Council's cabinet voted in      
OL,14,Ffavour of "preparatory work" before it 
OL,15,Fcould be handed enforcement powers by  
OL,16,Fthe government.                        
OL,18,FIt comes after the council agreed in   
OL,19,FJune to address "pavement, path and    
OL,20,Fverge parking" due to the impact on    
OL,21,Fpedestrians and other highway users.   
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
