OL,3,GNEWSAPavement parking ban moves a step 
OL,4,Acloser                                 
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC following Tuesday's
OL,7,Fvote, the authority's transport chief  
OL,8,FGareth Epps said the current pavement  
OL,9,Fparking situation was "really          
OL,10,Ffrustrating".                          
